    "detailed_description": "<i>Third Power</i> is a twist on the traditional puzzler, where players must balance alternating between two distinct forms and use the unique abilities of each in order to advance through a mysterious and dangerous cave system. You\u2019ll have to dodge traps and monsters, deflect projectiles, and decipher clues as you puzzle your way through the numerous stone chambers, each of which boasts unique challenges to overcome in order to progress.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077460/extras/b89b6be08ce1b577e9123e83c206e603.webp?t=1663109002\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077460/extras/43cd7e746ccb71511bd95682105970f2.poster.avif?t=1663109002\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077460/extras/43cd7e746ccb71511bd95682105970f2.webm?t=1663109002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077460/extras/43cd7e746ccb71511bd95682105970f2.mp4?t=1663109002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Creative Puzzles</strong><br>Each area presents new and exciting elements to discover. You\u2019ll have to rely on the powers associated with each of your forms to figure out how to get through to the next room. From hidden panels to mysterious switches to manipulating projectiles to traversing mazes, there is no shortage of exciting brain teasers and satisfying solutions laid out before you.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077460/extras/1c61b48f21269cfa38f29c7270ca16d3.poster.avif?t=1663109002\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077460/extras/1c61b48f21269cfa38f29c7270ca16d3.webm?t=1663109002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077460/extras/1c61b48f21269cfa38f29c7270ca16d3.mp4?t=1663109002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Dangerous Foes</strong><br>Keep your eyes up - or you might get encased by jelly! You may have to dodge a wolf that can manipulate your very form, too. Keep your wits about you and make the best use of your powers to avoid the creatures that defend these enchanted halls.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077460/extras/85339740b5a531b2ec0af3e5cc78d349.poster.avif?t=1663109002\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077460/extras/85339740b5a531b2ec0af3e5cc78d349.webm?t=1663109002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077460/extras/85339740b5a531b2ec0af3e5cc78d349.mp4?t=1663109002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Mysterious Lore</strong><br>As you make your way through the perilous chambers ahead, you\u2019ll uncover hints of a curse laid over the area, threatening anyone who dares move through the caves to satisfy their desire for fame or treasure. Will you be the first to achieve your goals without succumbing to the curse? Uncover the secrets of the tomb, before it\u2019s too late...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077460/extras/b89b6be08ce1b577e9123e83c206e603.webp?t=1663109002\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<i>Third Power</i> is a twist on the traditional puzzler, where players must balance alternating between two distinct forms and use the unique abilities of each in order to advance through a mysterious and dangerous cave system. You\u2019ll have to dodge traps and monsters, deflect projectiles, and decipher clues as you puzzle your way through the numerous stone chambers, each of which boasts unique challenges to overcome in order to progress.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077460/extras/b89b6be08ce1b577e9123e83c206e603.webp?t=1663109002\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077460/extras/43cd7e746ccb71511bd95682105970f2.poster.avif?t=1663109002\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077460/extras/43cd7e746ccb71511bd95682105970f2.webm?t=1663109002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077460/extras/43cd7e746ccb71511bd95682105970f2.mp4?t=1663109002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Creative Puzzles</strong><br>Each area presents new and exciting elements to discover. You\u2019ll have to rely on the powers associated with each of your forms to figure out how to get through to the next room. From hidden panels to mysterious switches to manipulating projectiles to traversing mazes, there is no shortage of exciting brain teasers and satisfying solutions laid out before you.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077460/extras/1c61b48f21269cfa38f29c7270ca16d3.poster.avif?t=1663109002\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077460/extras/1c61b48f21269cfa38f29c7270ca16d3.webm?t=1663109002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077460/extras/1c61b48f21269cfa38f29c7270ca16d3.mp4?t=1663109002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Dangerous Foes</strong><br>Keep your eyes up - or you might get encased by jelly! You may have to dodge a wolf that can manipulate your very form, too. Keep your wits about you and make the best use of your powers to avoid the creatures that defend these enchanted halls.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077460/extras/85339740b5a531b2ec0af3e5cc78d349.poster.avif?t=1663109002\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077460/extras/85339740b5a531b2ec0af3e5cc78d349.webm?t=1663109002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077460/extras/85339740b5a531b2ec0af3e5cc78d349.mp4?t=1663109002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Mysterious Lore</strong><br>As you make your way through the perilous chambers ahead, you\u2019ll uncover hints of a curse laid over the area, threatening anyone who dares move through the caves to satisfy their desire for fame or treasure. Will you be the first to achieve your goals without succumbing to the curse? Uncover the secrets of the tomb, before it\u2019s too late...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077460/extras/b89b6be08ce1b577e9123e83c206e603.webp?t=1663109002\" /></div>",
    "short_description": "Third Power is a unique puzzle adventure where players alternate between forms with distinct abilities in order to progress through a mysterious tomb. Avoid traps, solve puzzles, and uncover the secrets of an enigmatic curse as you advance toward discovering your third\u2014and final\u2014power.",
